// spec/core/connectorStorage.md, "Story: Retain full account and flow values under exact identities"; spec/core/connectorStorage.md, "Story: Connector account lifecycle"; spec/core/accountValues.md, "Story: Patch account policy without changing its durable identity"; spec/core/connectorHandoff.md, "Story: Transfer complete fallback state before invoking the next backend"; spec/core/connectorHandoff.md, "Backend replacement preserves facade identity and memoizes each current adapter"; spec/core/connectorQueues.md, "Story: Preserve callback and migration order after rejection"; spec/core/oauth/bridge.md, "Story: Preserve one-time flow ownership across durable and process state"; spec/core/oauth/verifiers.md, "Story: Use a one-time verifier only with its originating flow"; spec/core/oauth/index.md, "Story: Start authorization only after preserving its original state"; spec/core/oauth/index.md, "Story: Complete one authorization without reusing a consumed state"; spec/core/connectorManagers.md, "Story: Resolve account providers through the correct manager"
